  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you have an avatar where contacts constantly collide with receivers, they will not function upon joining a new instance.\n\nFor example, I use contacts attached to eye bones and two proximity-based receivers to do material swap or UV offset eye tracking. Upon joining a new instance, both contact receivers do not recognize the sender until they fully exit the proximity of said contact receivers. This only happens locally too. Remote players can still see the parameters updating, but the local player cannot.",
